                                      "content": "One of the most important pieces is the Google Business Profile (GBP). When homeowners search for local trades near them, these contractors' profiles don't show up in the results, while their competitors with strong profile & good reviews do. They've set up GBP, but not the right way, and they're not managing it actively. Their reviews are growing slowly, like they're stuck.",
                                      "fontSize": "$fs-sm",
                                      "lineHeight": 1.6
                                    }
                                  }
                                },
