                                    "icQFH": {
                                      "content": "They're spending hard-earned money on ads, yet their conversion rate is poor because the leads who click through land on a website that sits there like a statue. Not a high-converting, functional website that captures leads and instantly turns them into text conversations that go directly to the contractor's phone.",
